For HHb pKa 8.18, pH 7.4 < pKa, mostly protonated. Fraction protonated = 1/(1+10^(7.4-8.18)) = 1/(1+10^-0.78). 10^-0.78=0.1660. fraction=1/1.166=0.8577.

